<title>UK: Carlton to make provision for KTV.</title>
<headline>Carlton to make provision for KTV.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Carlton Communications Plc said on Tuesday that it would make a provision of up to four million stg for the liquidation of Channel KTV Pte Ltd.  </p>
<p>The media company is a minority shareholder in KTV, a Singapore-based karaoke music television business which broadcasts music videos over satellites, cable television and in clubs and hotels.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
